stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Retain the old environment for rollback
accDescr: Blue continues serving while green is prepared. After a CNAME swap blue remains available for a reverse swap.
state "Blue v1 serves, green v2 deploys" as Prepare
state "Green v2 tested, blue v1 serves" as Ready
state "Green v2 serves, blue v1 retained" as Cutover
state "Blue v1 serves again" as Rollback
[*] --> Prepare
Prepare --> Ready: Validation passes
Ready --> Cutover: Swap environment CNAMEs
Cutover --> Rollback: Error detected, reverse swap
Cutover --> [*]: Release accepted and old traffic drained
note right of Cutover
 DNS caches delay traffic movement.
 Keep both environments reachable.
end note
